#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:5
msgid "Renderers"
msgstr "渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Renderers produce camera-sensor buffers for policy observations and "
"synthetic-data workflows. They are distinct from :doc:`visualizers "
"<visualization>`, which provide human-facing, interactive views for "
"inspection, debugging, and recording. Isaac Lab uses a pluggable renderer "
"architecture. All implementations follow the interface defined by "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer`."
msgstr ""
"渲染器为策略观测和合成数据流程生成相机传感器缓冲区。它们不同于 :doc:`可视化器 <visualization>` "
"；后者为检查、调试和录制提供面向人的交互式视图。Isaac Lab 采用可插拔渲染器架构，所有实现均遵循 "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` 定义的接口。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:13
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports three rendering backends. See :ref:`renderer-details` for"
" their execution models, output coverage, and limitations, and :ref:`camera-"
"supported-annotators` for the output-by-backend support matrix."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持三种渲染后端。其运行方式、输出范围和限制见 :ref:`renderer-details` ，各输出在不同后端的支持情况见 "
":ref:`camera-supported-annotators` 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:19
msgid ""
"OVRTX is the recommended RTX renderer. Isaac RTX is the legacy RTX renderer:"
" it remains available for workflows that must run inside Isaac Sim, but new "
"RTX camera work should use OVRTX."
msgstr ""
"推荐使用 OVRTX 作为 RTX 渲染器。Isaac RTX 是旧版 RTX 渲染器，继续用于必须在 Isaac Sim 内运行的工作流；新的 RTX"
" 相机工作流应使用 OVRTX。"

