#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:66
msgid "Renderer outputs at a glance"
msgstr "渲染器输出概览"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:68
msgid ""
"Each renderer draws the same scene, camera, lights, and materials: six "
"spheres with mirror-like, transparent, semi-transparent, matte, glossy, and "
"emissive materials. RGB is animated; the other outputs are stills from the "
"same run. Newton Warp and OVRTX use Newton physics while Isaac RTX uses "
"PhysX, so sphere poses can differ."
msgstr ""
"各渲染器使用相同的场景、相机、灯光和材质：六个球体分别采用镜面、透明、半透明、哑光、光泽和自发光材质。RGB "
"以动画展示，其他输出是同次运行中的静态图。Newton Warp 和 OVRTX 使用 Newton 物理引擎，Isaac RTX 使用 "
"PhysX，因此球体位姿可能有所不同。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:73
msgid ""
"Minimal rows are the ``simple_shading_*`` outputs. Scalar, vector, and label"
" outputs are color-mapped for display: depth runs from near (purple) to far "
"(red), normals map X, Y, and Z to red, green, and blue, and motion-vector "
"arrows show sampled image-space motion. Cameras return the raw tensors "
"described in :ref:`camera-output-types`."
msgstr ""
"Minimal 各行对应 ``simple_shading_*`` "
"输出。标量、向量和标签输出经过颜色映射以便展示：深度由近处的紫色渐变为远处的红色，法线的 X、Y、Z "
"分量分别映射为红、绿、蓝，运动向量箭头表示采样点在图像空间中的运动。相机实际返回的原始张量见 :ref:`camera-output-types` 。"

