"Open a renderer below for its runtime, physics pairing, output coverage, "
"configuration, and typical use case."
msgstr "展开下方各渲染器，可查看其运行时、支持搭配的物理后端、输出范围、配置方式和典型用途。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "Newton Warp renderer"
msgstr "Newton Warp 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** A lightweight, kit-less Warp ray tracer included in"
" the base install. Pairs with Newton, OvPhysX, or Isaac Sim PhysX."
msgstr ""
"**运行时与物理后端：** 基础安装自带的轻量级 Warp 光线追踪器，不依赖 Kit。可搭配 Newton、OvPhysX 或 Isaac Sim "
"PhysX。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Produces RGB, albedo, depth, normals, semantic "
"segmentation, and instance segmentation with direct lighting. It does not "
"produce motion vectors or RTX material transport."
msgstr "**输出范围：** 采用直接光照，提供 RGB、反照率、深度、法线、语义分割和实例分割。不提供运动向量或 RTX 材质光传输。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:94
msgid ""
"**Configuration:** :class:`~isaaclab_newton.renderers.NewtonWarpRendererCfg`"
msgstr "**配置：** :class:`~isaaclab_newton.renderers.NewtonWarpRendererCfg`"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Best for:** Training workflows where throughput matters more than full RTX"
" fidelity."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 吞吐量比完整 RTX 保真度更重要的训练流程。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "OVRTX renderer"
msgstr "OVRTX 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** Provides kit-less RTX rendering through the "
"``isaaclab_ov`` extension and the ``ovrtx`` |ovrtx_docs_ref| runtime. Pairs "
"with Newton or OvPhysX; it cannot share a process with Kit."
msgstr ""
"**运行时与物理后端：** 通过 ``isaaclab_ov`` 扩展和 ``ovrtx`` |ovrtx_docs_ref| 运行时提供不依赖 Kit"
" 的 RTX 渲染。可搭配 Newton 或 OvPhysX，无法与 Kit 共处同一进程。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Provides RTX Minimal and photo-real rendering with "
"geometry, motion, and label outputs, plus :ref:`asynchronous rendering "
"<renderers-async-data-flow>`."
msgstr ""
"**输出范围：** 提供 RTX Minimal 和照片级真实感渲染，以及几何、运动和标签输出，并支持 :ref:`异步渲染 <renderers-"
"async-data-flow>` 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:104
msgid "**Configuration:** :class:`~isaaclab_ov.renderers.OVRTXRendererCfg`"
msgstr "**配置：** :class:`~isaaclab_ov.renderers.OVRTXRendererCfg`"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:105
msgid "**Best for:** RTX image quality without running Isaac Sim."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 无需运行 Isaac Sim 即可获得 RTX 图像质量。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "Isaac RTX renderer (legacy)"
msgstr "Isaac RTX 渲染器（旧版）"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** Runs NVIDIA's Omniverse RTX rendering pipeline "
"inside Isaac Sim and pairs with Isaac Sim PhysX or Newton."
msgstr ""
"**运行时与物理后端：** 在 Isaac Sim 内运行 NVIDIA 的 Omniverse RTX 渲染管线，可搭配 Isaac Sim "
"PhysX 或 Newton。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Provides RTX Minimal (Isaac Sim 6.0 or later) and "
"photo-real rendering, plus the broadest camera-output coverage."
msgstr "**输出范围：** 提供 RTX Minimal（Isaac Sim 6.0 及以上版本）和照片级真实感渲染，相机输出类型最为丰富。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Configuration:** :class:`~isaaclab_physx.renderers.IsaacRtxRendererCfg`"
msgstr "**配置：** :class:`~isaaclab_physx.renderers.IsaacRtxRendererCfg`"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:114
msgid "**Best for:** Workflows that must run inside Isaac Sim or Kit."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 必须在 Isaac Sim 或 Kit 内运行的工作流。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:117
msgid "Choosing a rendering capability"
msgstr "选择渲染功能"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:119
msgid ""
"The sections below group rendering by purpose: simplified rendering for "
"throughput-oriented training, photo-real rendering for full RTX image "
"quality, and advanced outputs for geometry, motion, and labels. The commands"
" use the suffixless ``Isaac-Cartpole-Camera`` task so each mode can be tried"
" without editing Python."
msgstr ""
"下文按用途介绍渲染方式：面向训练吞吐量的简化渲染、追求完整 RTX 图像质量的照片级真实感渲染，以及几何、运动和标签等高级输出。命令使用不带后缀的 "
"``Isaac-Cartpole-Camera`` 任务，无需修改 Python 即可尝试各模式。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:127
msgid "Simplified rendering"
msgstr "简化渲染"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:129
msgid ""
"Simplified rendering prioritizes throughput and predictable image formation "
"over full light transport. Newton Warp provides a lightweight ray-traced RGB"
" path. OVRTX and Isaac RTX provide RTX Minimal mode, which disables indirect"
" lighting and offers three levels of material evaluation:"
msgstr ""
"简化渲染优先保证吞吐量和可预测的成像结果，而非完整光传输。Newton Warp 提供轻量级光线追踪 RGB 路径。OVRTX 和 Isaac RTX "
"则提供 RTX Minimal 模式，关闭间接光照，并提供三个层次的材质计算："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:133
msgid "**Constant diffuse** uses one constant surface color."
msgstr "**常量漫反射** 使用单一的恒定表面颜色。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Diffuse MDL** is Isaac Lab's stable name for textured diffuse shading."
msgstr "**漫反射 MDL** 是 Isaac Lab 对带纹理漫反射着色所采用的稳定名称。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Full MDL** is Isaac Lab's stable name for diffuse, glossy, and emissive "
"material evaluation."
msgstr "**完整 MDL** 是 Isaac Lab 对漫反射、光泽和自发光材质求值所采用的稳定名称。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:137
msgid ""
"Requesting a ``simple_shading_*`` output switches that camera to RTX "
"Minimal, so request regular color from a separate camera. RTX Minimal uses "
"the first distant light in the scene and hard shadows. See the :ovrtx-"
"docs:`OVRTX Minimal mode <sensors/cameras/render_modes/minimal.rst>` and "
"`RTX Minimal renderer <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/rtx-renderer_minimal.html>`_ documentation for the "
"renderer-level settings and limitations."
msgstr ""
"请求 ``simple_shading_*`` 输出会将该相机切换为 RTX Minimal，因此常规彩色图像应由另一台相机输出。RTX Minimal"
" 使用场景中的第一盏平行光，并生成硬阴影。渲染器层面的设置和限制见 :ovrtx-docs:`OVRTX Minimal 模式 "
"<sensors/cameras/render_modes/minimal.rst>` 及 `RTX Minimal 渲染器 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-rendering/latest/rtx-"
"renderer_minimal.html>`_ 文档。"

